  "body": "First time on the market since this exceptional custom masonry residence was built for the current owners, this is a home of remarkable scale, craftsmanship, and specification.\r\n\r\nBold in design yet effortlessly functional, it offers a rare opportunity to secure a resort-inspired family sanctuary in the heart of Mission Bay.\r\n\r\nSoaring double-height ceilings, expansive glazing, polished concrete floors and a striking material palette create an interior of genuine presence, while generous living spaces connect seamlessly with the outdoors. At the heart of the home, the designer kitchen features multiple premium Wolf appliances and a substantial fully equipped butler's pantry.\r\n\r\nPositioned on an impressive 878sqm (more or less) freehold site, the outdoor environment is equally compelling. Living areas flow to a covered louvred entertaining terrace with outdoor fireplace, before extending to the level lawn, swimming pool and fully self-contained pavilion complete with gym, storage, bathroom and bedroom accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe level of detail throughout is exceptional. Features include ducted heating and cooling, automated and hidden window coverings, heated outdoor saltwater pool and shower with an automated hard pool cover, fabulous sound systems both indoor and outdoor, smart irrigation, and ensuites to every bedroom to name just a few.\r\n\r\nA secure gated entrance, double garaging and extensive off-street parking for additional vehicles or a boat complete the offering. Conveniently located within walking distance of Eastridge Shopping Centre and zoned for Kohimarama School and Selwyn College.\r\n\r\nHomes of this calibre rarely come to the market. Designed without compromise and executed to an exceptional standard, this is a residence that must be experienced firsthand to be fully appreciated.",
